uthor_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2556696327/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715868271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100358#issuecomment-2715868271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100358","id":2715868271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h4Nxv","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T22:45:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T22:45:28Z","body":"> I'm not sure what would be causing this.\r\n\r\nThank you again for testing!\r\nMy first thought is the `strlen` call; possibly it's causing the function to be inserted and inlined many times throughout various functions.\r\nI think this would have been less of an issue in `String`, since there most constructors can just evaluate `strlen` at compile time. Possibly, in this case, it's inlined too far in and has already lost `constexpr` information by then, necessitating `strlen` to be compiled alongside it.\r\n\r\nI think 600kb isn't really worth the speed gains, so I'll convert to draft while I try to reduce it back down.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715868271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825632223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100358#issuecomment-2825632223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100358","id":2825632223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oa7nf","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T22:31:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T22:31:27Z","body":"Superseded by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104985","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is